Error [jet.UnknownMethod]: `sum` is a method of `Point`, not a function
  --> tests/ui/call_spelling_method_call.jet:8:11
    |
  8 |     print(sum(p))
    |           ^^^
 Why: A method is called on its value, which goes before the dot; only a free function whose first parameter is `#Root` takes both spellings
 Fix: Call it on the value: `value.sum(…)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
